    "description": "<p class=\"p1\">This archive contains annual land&ndash;ocean particulate organic carbon (POC) flux estimates for 2,409 global rivers from 1984 to 2018 (raw data), together with associated river mouth points and river polylines. Users are encouraged to use Version 2 of this dataset for research and related applications.</p>\n<p class=\"p1\">For questions, comments, or feedback, please contact the corresponding author, Prof. Dongfeng Li (dongfeng.li@pku.edu.cn).</p>\n<p class=\"p1\">An interactive visualization website for this dataset is also available at: https://qqq196988.github.io/website/.</p>"
